1.1.	Technical support in the implementation of updates to the SAISE based on the amended concept of the system provided and e-Day Module updated
1.2.	 Solution for the public disclosure of electoral data (data warehouse) developed
2.1. Curriculum and textbook for the electoral education in schools - developed ;
2.2. Participation of Moldovan men and women in electoral education increased through civic education and voter information programs and at least 20,000 direct beneficiaries – reached; 
3.1. Update of the functionalities of the Financial Control Module provided; 
3.2. Support for the implementation of a Roadmap for the scale-up of the CEC Economic and Financial Department provided 
4.1 Mobilization support of various partners within the framework of the Election Partners’ Platform 
4.3. CEC anti-fraud and anti-corruption Guide in election campaigns developed; 
5.1. Needs assessment and curricula on electoral education in universities developed; 
5.2 Training and awareness raising activities to enhance the knowledge on inclusive democratic and electoral processes for youth and women wings of political parties – delivered; 
6.1. Concept of a dedicated civic engagement campaign targeting pro-active youth currently residing abroad developed - delivered; 
6.2 Support the implementation of the CEC Communication Strategy 2020-2023 
7.1. Accessibility of 1206 public buildings that host polling stations during elections assessed
